! No Global Now ~ the clockless lease, mined

''The charge (operator, 2026-09-13, quote license).'' On the two clockless gaps the probe `e2da729e4` pinned: //"4) agree but send a sporit to the jsonl conversation mines to gather our intent from the design conversations amd memes. \"No Global Now\" holds."//

''What this carrier does and does not do.'' It gathers INTENT from the house's own words — 69 transcripts and 92 carriers — and settles each question from the mines alone. It changes no code, no test and no existing carrier. Where the mines run silent it says so at #/silence rather than reaching for a plausible answer. Every operator sentence below carries its date; a ruling outranks a lean, and the latest ruling outranks an earlier one unless the earlier one holds a scope the later never touched.

''Register: Mined-Testimony.'' Quotes ride under quote license; the copulas inside them belong to their speakers.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-mines>>

